          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Star eyes Immortal Gu cannot be used immediately. Before using it, the user must connect with the stars and refine a star. One night of that work costs Fang Yuan eight beads of immortal essence, and he judges that refining a star costs around ten attempts at refining rank six Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          988
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "weakness-and-preparation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Star eyes Immortal Gu is among the Immortal Gu Fang Yuan obtains again, and among star path Gu worms only star eyes Immortal Gu returns to his possession.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
